=== SURVEY ===
Surveyed existing widget patterns:
- WarrantyStatusWidget.tsx: same hook envelope pattern, WidgetDetailCard usage, vehicleId→string conversion
- VehicleSpecsWidget.tsx: vehicleId resolution via useVehicles fallback
- WidgetDetailCard: entries/compact/emptyMessage/emptyIcon interface
- WidgetShell: freshness props (updatedAt, isFetching, isStale, isError, onRefresh)
- useVehicleSubscriptions(vehicleId?: string) returns VehicleInfoEnvelope<Record<string, unknown>>
- registry.ts: 1119 lines, CreditCard already imported

=== REASONING ===
Widget follows the WarrantyStatusWidget pattern closely:
1. Resolve vehicleId (number→string) via useVehicles fallback
2. Call useVehicleSubscriptions(stringId)
3. Parse untyped data envelope into typed ParsedSub[] (handles both known keys and generic subscriptions array)
4. Map ParsedSub[] → DetailEntry[] for WidgetDetailCard
5. Compact mode: active count + next expiry badge
6. Standard mode: full list via WidgetDetailCard with active/expired badges
All strings via useTranslation('dashboard'). Null-safe throughout.

